{"id":"15263453","articleId":"13364250","title":"Does Polymarket Have a Token?","description":"","blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"All trading and liquidity rewards are in <a href=\"https://docs.polymarket.com/concepts/pusd\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pUSD</a>, Polymarket's official collateral token. pUSD is a standard ERC-20 token on Polygon, backed by USDC.","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" ","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Polymarket has not announced plans for any airdrop or token generation event. Be wary of scams claiming airdrops, giveaways, etc. Announcements will only come from official channels.","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" ","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"If in doubt, refer to official Polymarket communication channels:","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"unorderedNestedList","text":"- Web: <b><a href=\"https://polymarket.com/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://polymarket.com</a></b>\n- Twitter / X: <b><a href=\"https://x.com/polymarket\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://x.com/polymarket</a></b>\n- Discord: <b><a href=\"https://discord.gg/polymarket\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://discord.gg/polymarket</a></b>","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Web: <b><a href=\"https://polymarket.com/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://polymarket.com</a></b>","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Twitter / X: <b><a href=\"https://x.com/polymarket\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://x.com/polymarket</a></b>","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Discord: <b><a href=\"https://discord.gg/polymarket\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://discord.gg/polymarket</a></b>","class":"no-margin"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","text":"<br>​","class":"